#! clause: E8.6
#! mode: drive
#! break: 15
#! do: continue
#! expect: paused breakpoint @ 15:7
#! do: continue
#! expect: paused breakpoint @ 15:7
#! do: continue
#! expect: paused breakpoint @ 15:7
#! do: continue
#! expect: completed
# A breakpoint in a loop body fires once per iteration (per-iteration refire, S-21).
let i = 0
while i < 3 do
  i = i + 1
end
